    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2 data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2926\">Level 18 — <strong data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2926\">Final Crescendo</strong></h2><p data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2956\">You burn everything at once.</p><h3 data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2980\">Once per Soma Break</h3><p data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"2999\">As a bonus action:</p><ul data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3153\"><li data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3034\"><p data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3034\">You immediately enter <strong data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3034\">Burn 4</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3153\"><p data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3062\">For the rest of the turn:</p><ul data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3153\"><li data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3102\"><p data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3102\">All attacks deal <strong data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3102\">maximum damage</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3153\"><p data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3153\">You may cleave freely (no once-per-turn limit)</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3168\">Aftermath</h3><ul data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3364\"><li data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3195\"><p data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3195\">Your Burn drops to <strong data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3195\">0</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3364\"><p data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3229\">You suffer <strong data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3228\">severe backlash</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3364\"><li data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3267\"><p data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3267\">roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on attacks and saves</p></li><li data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3322\"><p data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3322\">Speed reduced to 0 until the end of your next turn</p></li><li data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3364\"><p data-start=\"3327\" data-end=\"3364\">GM may impose a narrative consequence</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3398\">The hymn always ends in silence.</p><hr data-start=\"3400\" data-end=\"3403\" /><h3 data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3431\"></h3>",
      "chat": ""
    },
